@startuml 05-implantacao
skinparam shadowing false

title Despliegue — ejemplos (Docker local, borde, nube opcional)

node "Máquina de desarrollo" as Dev {
  artifact "docker compose\n(code/docker-compose.yml)" as DC
  node "contenedor frontend\n:3000→80" as Cfe
  node "contenedor backend\n:8080" as Cbe
  artifact "volumen backend → ./backend" as Vol
}

node "Raspberry Pi / PiCarX" as Pi {
  artifact "venv + publish_picarx_dht22.py" as Agen
  artifact "unit systemd\n(local o remoto)" as Sysd
}

node "Nube (opcional)\nGCP Cloud Run / App Engine" as Cloud {
  artifact "imágenes Docker / build estático" as Img
}

cloud "Red (LAN / Internet)" as Net

Cfe -down- Cbe : puente iot-network
Vol .. Cbe
DC .. Cfe
DC .. Cbe

Agen .. Net
Cbe .. Net : **api/ingest** y **GET** datos
Sysd .. Agen : inicia / reinicia agente
Img .. Net : mismo contrato HTTP si deploy remoto

note bottom of Cloud
  Frontend y backend pueden publicarse
  por separado; el publicador en la Pi usa **PUBLISH_URL**
  apuntando al endpoint público o VPN.
end note

@enduml
